# Carlo Gavazzi ET112.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Carlo Gavazzi ET112 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: carlo-gavazzi-em111-em112-et112-modbus.pdf (EM100/ET100 Series V2 Rev.14)
# | - Single-phase energy meter with tariff management and hour counter.
# | - Same measurement registers as EM111/EM112, with the addition of:
# | - Hour counter at address 44 (0x2C) — hours*100, scale=0.01 (ET112 only)
# | - INT32 word order: LSW->MSW → word_order = "le". INT16: no word_order.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 1 stop bit, no parity.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Carlo Gavazzi
@model=ET112
@description=Single-phase energy meter with tariff management — same as EM111 plus hour counter register. V/I/P/Q/S, PF, frequency, imported/exported energy.
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/carlo-gavazzi-et112.toml; Source: carlo-gavazzi-em111-em112-et112-modbus.pdf (EM100/ET100 Series V2 Rev.14). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

